{
  "zh-CN": {
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_NAME": "Henry",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_DESCRIPTION": "Henry 是一名身手矫健的战士，擅长使用庞大的武器库击倒敌人。<color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > 剑非常全能，而拳击手套更适合痛击强大的敌人。\n\n< ! > 手枪冷却短、伤害高，是强力的对空武器。\n\n< ! > 翻滚附带持续的护甲增益，有助于主动进攻。\n\n< ! > 炸弹可以轻松清除成群的敌人。</color>",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SUBTITLE": "天选之人",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_LORE": "示例背景",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "..于是他离开了，去寻找新的身份。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_OUTRO_FAILURE": "..于是他消失了，永远是一张白纸。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_DEFAULT_SKIN_NAME": "默认",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_MASTERY_SKIN_NAME": "替代",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_TYPHOON_SKIN_NAME": "V1",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_DANTE_SKIN_NAME": "Dante",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_VERGIL_SKIN_NAME": "Vergil",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SAMURAI_SKIN_NAME": "武士",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SOLDIER_SKIN_NAME": "冠军",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_ZOMBIE_SKIN_NAME": "僵尸",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SKELETON_SKIN_NAME": "骷髅",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PASSIVE_NAME": "Henry 被动",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "示例文本。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PRIMARY_SLASH_NAME": "剑",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PRIMARY_SLASH_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>敏捷。</style>向前挥砍，造成<style=cIsDamage>280%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PRIMARY_PUNCH_NAME": "拳击手套",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PRIMARY_PUNCH_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>敏捷。</style>快速出拳，造成<style=cIsDamage>240%伤害</style>。<style=cIsUtility>无视护甲。</style>",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PRIMARY_GUN_NAME": "手枪",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PRIMARY_GUN_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>敏捷。</style>发射小型手枪，造成<style=cIsDamage>90%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SECONDARY_GUN_NAME": "手枪",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SECONDARY_GUN_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>敏捷。</style>发射手枪，造成<style=cIsDamage>420%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SECONDARY_STINGER_NAME": "Stinger",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SECONDARY_STINGER_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>敏捷。</style>突刺向敌人，造成<style=cIsDamage>450%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SECONDARY_UZI_NAME": "Uzi",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SECONDARY_UZI_DESCRIPTION": "发射 Uzi，造成<style=cIsDamage>75%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_UTILITY_ROLL_NAME": "翻滚",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_UTILITY_ROLL_DESCRIPTION": "短距离翻滚，获得<style=cIsUtility>300护甲</style>。<style=cIsUtility>翻滚期间不会被击中。</style>",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_UTILITY_SHOTGUN_NAME": "霰弹枪",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_UTILITY_SHOTGUN_DESCRIPTION": "发射<style=cIsUtility>霰弹枪</style>，造成<style=cIsDamage>14x140%伤害</style>，并借助后坐力弹射自己。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SPECIAL_BOMB_NAME": "炸弹",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SPECIAL_BOMB_DESCRIPTION": "投掷炸弹，造成<style=cIsDamage>1600%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPBOMB_NAME": "更多炸弹！",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPBOMB_DESCRIPTION": "投掷炸弹，造成<style=cIsDamage>1600%伤害</style>。\n<color=#d299ff>SCEPTER：最多持有4枚炸弹。冷却时间减半。</color>",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SPECIAL_BAZOOKA_NAME": "火箭筒",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SPECIAL_BAZOOKA_DESCRIPTION": "蓄力并发射火箭，造成<style=cIsDamage>600%-1600%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PRIMARY_BAZOOKA_NAME": "开火",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PRIMARY_BAZOOKA_DESCRIPTION": "蓄力并发射火箭，造成<style=cIsDamage>600%-1600%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PRIMARY_BAZOOKAOUT_NAME": "取消",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PRIMARY_BAZOOKAOUT_DESCRIPTION": "收起你的<style=cIsDamage>火箭筒</style>。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPBAZOOKA_NAME": "Armageddon",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPBAZOOKA_DESCRIPTION": "蓄力并发射火箭，造成<style=cIsDamage>600%-1600%伤害</style>。\n<color=#d299ff>SCEPTER：同时持有两把火箭筒。</color>",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PRIMARY_SCEPBAZOOKA_NAME": "开火",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_PRIMARY_SCEPBAZOOKA_DESCRIPTION": "蓄力并发射火箭，造成<style=cIsDamage>600%-1600%伤害</style>。\n<color=#d299ff>SCEPTER：同时持有两把火箭筒。</color>",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SPECIAL_FRENZY_NAME": "狂暴",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SPECIAL_FRENZY_DESCRIPTION": "命中时积攒<style=cIsHealth>怒气</style>。充满后使用，进入<style=cIsDamage>狂乱</style>状态，持续<style=cIsUtility>10秒</style>。<style=cIsHealth>生命值越低充能越快。</style>",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPFRENZY_NAME": "Super Saiyan",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_SPECIAL_SCEPFRENZY_DESCRIPTION": "近距离主要技能命中或任何近战攻击都会积攒<style=cIsHealth>怒气</style>。充满后使用，进入<style=cIsDamage>狂乱</style>状态，持续<style=cIsUtility>10秒</style>。<style=cIsHealth>生命值越低充能越快。</style>\n<color=#d299ff>SCEPTER：属性加成大幅提高。持续时间延长。</color>",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ROB_HENRY_BODY_UNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_NAME": "序曲",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ROB_HENRY_BODY_UNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_DESCRIPTION": "进入 Titanic Plains。",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ROB_HENRY_BODY_MASTERYUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_NAME": "Henry：精通",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ROB_HENRY_BODY_MASTERYUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_DESCRIPTION": "使用 Henry 在 Monsoon 难度下通关或湮灭。",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ROB_HENRY_BODY_TYPHOONUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_NAME": "Henry：大师精通",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_ROB_HENRY_BODY_TYPHOONUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_ID_DESCRIPTION": "使用 Henry 在 Typhoon 或 Eclipse 难度下通关或湮灭。\n<color=#8888>（任意 Typhoon 或更高难度均计入）</color>",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_DANTEUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Henry：头奖",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_DANTEUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_DESC": "使用 Henry 在 Monsoon 难度下击败一名 Twisted Scavenger。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_DANTEUNLOCKABLE_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "Henry：头奖",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_VERGILUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Henry：200%干劲",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_VERGILUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_DESC": "使用 Henry 在不携带任何物品的情况下击败 King of Nothing。",
    "ROB_HENRY_BODY_VERGILUNLOCKABLE_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "Henry：200%干劲",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_NAME": "Mr. Green",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_DESCRIPTION": "Mr. Green<color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > 剑非常全能，而拳击手套更适合痛击强大的敌人。\n\n< ! > 手枪冷却短、伤害高，是强力的对空武器。\n\n< ! > 翻滚附带持续的护甲增益，有助于主动进攻。\n\n< ! > 炸弹可以轻松清除成群的敌人。</color>",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_SUBTITLE": "那位",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_LORE": "示例背景第2部分",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "..于是他离开了，底部文字。",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_DEFAULT_SKIN_NAME": "默认",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_PASSIVE_NAME": "Mr. Green 被动",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "示例文本。",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_PRIMARY_PUNCH_NAME": "武术",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_PRIMARY_PUNCH_DESCRIPTION": "施展快速的拳脚连击，造成<style=cIsDamage>90%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_SECONDARY_CLONETHROW_NAME": "投掷克隆体",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_SECONDARY_CLONETHROW_DESCRIPTION": "召唤一个克隆体并向前投掷，抓住附近敌人并将其砸向地面，造成<style=cIsDamage>420%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_UTILITY_DASH_NAME": "People's Elbow",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_UTILITY_DASH_DESCRIPTION": "短距离冲刺。接触<style=cIsUtility>克隆体</style>时跃入空中，以强力<style=cIsUtility>肘击</style>落下，造成<style=cIsDamage>800%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_SPECIAL_RES_NAME": "复活",
    "ROB_MRGREEN_BODY_SPECIAL_RES_DESCRIPTION": "复活所有倒下的克隆体。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_NAME": "Nemesis Henry",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_DESCRIPTION": "Nemesis Henry 是一名暴躁的剑士，挥舞着能储存能量以强化攻击的特殊刀刃。他没有冷却时间，但必须妥善管理能量。<color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > 剑形态用于积攒能量，而枪形态消耗能量发动强力攻击。\n\n< ! > Swordmaster 可以蓄力以造成更高伤害。\n\n< ! > Flash Step 是强力的进攻手段，有助于积攒能量。\n\n< ! > 使用 Hydra Bite 保持生命健康，使用 Hyper Beam 倾泻巨量伤害。</color>",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SUBTITLE": "堕落者",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_LORE": "示例背景",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "..于是他离开了，毫无明显理由地炸毁了月球。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_OUTRO_FAILURE": "..他如此努力，走得如此遥远。但到头来，一切都无关紧要。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_DEFAULT_SKIN_NAME": "Nemesis",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_MASTERY_SKIN_NAME": "囚徒 #001",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_TYPHOON_SKIN_NAME": "FLLFFL",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_PASSIVE_NAME": "酸蚀枪刃",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "Nemesis Henry 挥舞着一把可在剑形态与枪形态间切换的特殊武器。此外，他的技能没有常规冷却时间，而是依赖刀刃的<style=cIsHealing>能量</style>系统。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_PRIMARY_SPEAR_NAME": "穿刺",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_PRIMARY_SPEAR_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>敏捷。</style>向前刺击，造成<style=cIsDamage>160%伤害</style>。<style=cIsDamage>刃尖命中造成双倍伤害，并治疗所造成伤害的<style=cIsHealing>50%</style></style>。",
    "ROB_WEAPON_SWAP_SKILL": "武器切换",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_PRIMARY_SWORD_NAME": "剑形态",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_PRIMARY_SWORD_DESCRIPTION": "向前挥动刀刃，造成<style=cIsDamage>280%伤害</style>。命中时生成<style=cIsHealing>20%能量</style>。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_PRIMARY_GUN_NAME": "枪形态",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_PRIMARY_GUN_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>2.5%能量。</style>发射穿透性的<style=cIsHealing>能量</style>弹，造成<style=cIsDamage>350%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_PRIMARY_SWORDCSS_NAME": "剑形态 / 枪形态",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_PRIMARY_SWORDCSS_DESCRIPTION": "挥动刀刃，造成<style=cIsDamage>280%伤害</style>。命中时生成<style=cIsHealing>20%能量</style>。\n<style=cIsHealing>2.5%能量。</style>发射穿透性的<style=cIsHealing>能量</style>弹，造成<style=cIsDamage>350%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SECONDARY_BLAST_NAME": "Null Blast",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SECONDARY_BLAST_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>敏捷。</style>投掷一团<style=cIsHealth>神秘能量</style>，造成<style=cIsDamage>450%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SECONDARY_CHARGE_NAME": "Swordmaster",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SECONDARY_CHARGE_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>10%能量。</style>突袭附近敌人，造成<style=cIsDamage>600%伤害</style>。若在近战范围内，则改为发动连击。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SECONDARY_TORRENT_NAME": "Gunslinger",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SECONDARY_TORRENT_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>5%能量。</style>发射一连串<style=cIsHealing>能量</style>弹。按住以持续射击，每次射击消耗更多<style=cIsHealing>能量</style>。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SECONDARY_CHARGECSS_NAME": "Swordmaster / Gunslinger",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SECONDARY_CHARGECSS_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>10%能量。</style>突袭附近敌人，造成<style=cIsDamage>600%伤害</style>。\n<style=cIsHealing>5%能量。</style>发射一连串<style=cIsHealing>能量</style>弹。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_UTILITY_DODGESLASH_NAME": "迅捷斩",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_UTILITY_DODGESLASH_DESCRIPTION": "向后空翻并斩击附近敌人，造成<style=cIsDamage>300%伤害</style>。<style=cIsUtility>空翻期间不会被击中。</style>",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_UTILITY_BLINK_NAME": "Flash Step",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_UTILITY_BLINK_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>5%能量。</style><style=cIsUtility>瞬间闪现</style>至附近敌人身边。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_UTILITY_BURST_NAME": "能量爆发",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_UTILITY_BURST_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>10%能量。</style>释放一阵<style=cIsHealing>能量</style>爆发，造成<style=cIsDamage>400%伤害</style>，<style=cIsUtility>借助后坐力弹射自己</style>。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_UTILITY_BLINKCSS_NAME": "Flash Step / 能量爆发",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_UTILITY_BLINKCSS_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>5%能量。</style><style=cIsUtility>瞬间闪现</style>至附近敌人身边。\n<style=cIsHealing>10%能量。</style>释放一阵<style=cIsHealing>能量</style>爆发，造成<style=cIsDamage>400%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SPECIAL_STAB_NAME": "Hydra Bite",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SPECIAL_STAB_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>100%能量。</style>将刀刃刺入敌人，造成<style=cIsDamage>2800%伤害</style>并施加强力减益。<style=cIsHealing>治疗相当于所造成伤害50%的生命值。</style>",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SPECIAL_BEAM_NAME": "Hyper Beam",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SPECIAL_BEAM_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>100%能量。</style>蓄力发射强力激光弹幕，造成<style=cIsDamage>10x420%伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SPECIAL_STABCSS_NAME": "Hydra Bite / Hyper Beam",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_SPECIAL_STABCSS_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsHealing>100%能量。</style>将刀刃刺入敌人，造成<style=cIsDamage>2800%伤害</style>并施加强力减益。<style=cIsHealing>治疗相当于所造成伤害50%的生命值。</style>\n<style=cIsHealing>100%能量。</style>蓄力发射强力光束，造成<style=cIsDamage>大量伤害</style>。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_UNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "???",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_UNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_DESC": "击败 Henry 的残影。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_UNLOCKABLE_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "???",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_MASTERYUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Nemesis Henry：精通",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_MASTERYUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_DESC": "使用 Nemesis Henry 在 Monsoon 难度下通关或湮灭。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_MASTERYUNLOCKABLE_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "Nemesis Henry：精通",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_TYPHOONUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Nemesis Henry：大师精通",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_TYPHOONUNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_DESC": "使用 Nemesis Henry 在 Typhoon 难度下通关或湮灭。",
    "ROB_NEMRY_BODY_TYPHOONUNLOCKABLE_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "Nemesis Henry：大师精通"
  }
}
